    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunar Frontline is a near-future FPS where humanity has expanded to the Moon. Two factions \u2014 the Lunar Development Corp. (LDC) and the Union for Space Solidarity (USS) \u2014 fight over rare resources. You can choose to join either side in the conflict\u2014or cooperate to face unknown enemies on the Moon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/04cf1cf3e1bedec97908ee74f0155a8b.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/04cf1cf3e1bedec97908ee74f0155a8b.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/04cf1cf3e1bedec97908ee74f0155a8b.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game presents a vision of near-future lunar warfare, where you can pilot Moon-designed tanks, armored vehicles, and even exoskeleton mechs in low-gravity combat. Battle for control of iconic locations such as historic landing sites, helium-3 mines, and bio-research labs\u2014or fight to escape from mysterious zombie attacks. The conflict on the Moon will eventually expand to outposts on other planets, including Saturn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlefield Domination Mode</strong>:<br>Players can pilot a variety of lunar vehicles and engage in large-scale battles across open plains. Fight to capture and hold flag points scattered across the map. The faction that holds the points for the longest total time wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/1674f3a4095a99f275f232586d220113.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/1674f3a4095a99f275f232586d220113.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/1674f3a4095a99f275f232586d220113.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Evacuation Mode</strong>:<br>A chaotic three-way battle between the LDC, the USS, and a mysterious faction that has unleashed hordes of zombies. Players must reach and capture the evacuation point before the rival human faction, then defend it until successful evacuation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/b27aa085260a517b8150cdcf75441a7e.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/b27aa085260a517b8150cdcf75441a7e.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/b27aa085260a517b8150cdcf75441a7e.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/bb5d923070e0936d354ba06ea08988c4.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/bb5d923070e0936d354ba06ea08988c4.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/bb5d923070e0936d354ba06ea08988c4.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch Mode</strong>:<br>A fair 5v5 combat scenario. The team that eliminates the most enemies before time runs out claims victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/2dca6021ba89ced067ac7bb528471951.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/2dca6021ba89ced067ac7bb528471951.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/2dca6021ba89ced067ac7bb528471951.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LDC &amp; USS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/479fde7a15cfac3dc14209637bd8b558.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/479fde7a15cfac3dc14209637bd8b558.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/479fde7a15cfac3dc14209637bd8b558.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/6880271517d0d7334ea57943b9231e4a.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/6880271517d0d7334ea57943b9231e4a.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/6880271517d0d7334ea57943b9231e4a.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunar Frontline is a near-future FPS where humanity has expanded to the Moon. Two factions \u2014 the Lunar Development Corp. (LDC) and the Union for Space Solidarity (USS) \u2014 fight over rare resources. You can choose to join either side in the conflict\u2014or cooperate to face unknown enemies on the Moon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/04cf1cf3e1bedec97908ee74f0155a8b.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/04cf1cf3e1bedec97908ee74f0155a8b.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/04cf1cf3e1bedec97908ee74f0155a8b.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game presents a vision of near-future lunar warfare, where you can pilot Moon-designed tanks, armored vehicles, and even exoskeleton mechs in low-gravity combat. Battle for control of iconic locations such as historic landing sites, helium-3 mines, and bio-research labs\u2014or fight to escape from mysterious zombie attacks. The conflict on the Moon will eventually expand to outposts on other planets, including Saturn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlefield Domination Mode</strong>:<br>Players can pilot a variety of lunar vehicles and engage in large-scale battles across open plains. Fight to capture and hold flag points scattered across the map. The faction that holds the points for the longest total time wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/1674f3a4095a99f275f232586d220113.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/1674f3a4095a99f275f232586d220113.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/1674f3a4095a99f275f232586d220113.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Evacuation Mode</strong>:<br>A chaotic three-way battle between the LDC, the USS, and a mysterious faction that has unleashed hordes of zombies. Players must reach and capture the evacuation point before the rival human faction, then defend it until successful evacuation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/b27aa085260a517b8150cdcf75441a7e.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/b27aa085260a517b8150cdcf75441a7e.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/b27aa085260a517b8150cdcf75441a7e.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/bb5d923070e0936d354ba06ea08988c4.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/bb5d923070e0936d354ba06ea08988c4.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/bb5d923070e0936d354ba06ea08988c4.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch Mode</strong>:<br>A fair 5v5 combat scenario. The team that eliminates the most enemies before time runs out claims victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/2dca6021ba89ced067ac7bb528471951.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/2dca6021ba89ced067ac7bb528471951.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/2dca6021ba89ced067ac7bb528471951.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LDC &amp; USS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/479fde7a15cfac3dc14209637bd8b558.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/479fde7a15cfac3dc14209637bd8b558.webm?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/479fde7a15cfac3dc14209637bd8b558.mp4?t=1751657896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras/6880271517d0d7334ea57943b9231e4a.poster.avif?t=1751657896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840820/extras